{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：07:56 2026-10-08 HKT<br/>發佈時間：07:56 2026-10-08 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：07:56 2026-10-08 HKT</p><p>秀茂坪發生淋紅油事件。今日（8日）清晨6時40分，警方接獲報案，指兩名立法會議員鄧家彪與陳沛良位於秀茂坪邨秀緻樓地下的聯合辦事處，遭人淋潑紅色油漆破壞。人員到場發現辦事處的鐵閘、門外牆身及牆身貼有的宣傳海報均沾染紅油，經調查後將案件列作刑事毀壞，正調查犯案動機並追緝歹徒。</p><img alt=\"鄧家彪與陳沛良議員辦事處遭淋紅油。黎志偉攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/085fbb06fc43540f87e420e804bcf84a/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-08_at_07_40_40.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"辦事處門外牆身及張貼的宣傳海報均沾染紅油。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/5929bd9f95d0bb45688f0ba4c568049b/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-08_at_07_40_39.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/e5ae079126c9da30117b47b15b50fc4f/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-08_at_07_40_38_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/f01cb846aa5e61bbf96fda92d72b2406/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-08_at_07_40_38.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/9f7cc71f3713147b47c86f47a467ddcd/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-08_at_07_40_36.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警方到場調查。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/0e3e928c1882b75935b0dcee9bcb3a85/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-08_at_07_40_42.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/3d84336059e33fab073e79afb2faf2c0/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-08_at_07_40_40_1_.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-08T00:18:33.115444+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":219,"images":7,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}